    "player_hint_1_en": "There's someone on the bed, per the general clue. Block the rest of C5. (B) is in R9, west of (D), this isolates (B) in the last R9 square, R9 C7. ",
    "player_hint_2_en": "No room was empty according to the general clue. There are exactly five rooms between R1 and R5: the Bathroom, the Main Bedroom, the Living Room, the Dining Room and the Kitchen. To respect the general clue, there must be exactly one person in each of these rooms.\nWho can possibly be alone in the Kitchen? (H) is the only possibility.",
