    "player_hint_4_en": "Then, who can be the person alone in the Living Room? (F) is the only possibility at this point. (G) and (A) are in R1 and R2, this isolates (H) in the Kitchen in R3 C9. This isolates (F) in the last Living Room chair, R5 C3.",
    "player_hint_5_en": "Someone must be in the last Dining Room square, R4 C8. We know that (D) and (H) are the only two people in C8-C9, this isolates (D) in R4 C8.",
    "player_hint_6_en": "This isolates an unknown person in the last R8 square : R8 C4. Block the rest of C4.\nThis also isolates someone in the last C6 square : R6 C6, block the rest of C6.",
    "player_hint_7_en": "There are exactly two people sitting in a chair according to the general clue, this isolates (G) in the last remaining chair, in R2 C1. This isolates (A).",
    "player_hint_8_en": "This isolates (C) in the last square beside a shelf, R8 C4, then (E) in the last square not beside a TV, then (V).\n(V) was alone with (E), Elodie is the murderer!"
